		  MaskDescription	  "Used in biplex pipelined FFT. Implements \n(a+bi)(c+di) as (ac-bd)+i(ad+bc) with four \nmultipl"
		  "iers"
		  MaskPromptString	  "Coefficients:|Coefficient Step Period (2^?)|Store coefficients in BRAM|Coefficient Bit Width|I"
		  "nput Bit Width|Add Latency|Mult Latency|BRAM Latency|Convert Latency|Architecture|Use behavioural HDL for multipli"
		  "ers|Use embedded multipliers|Quantization Behavior|Overflow Behavior"
		  MaskStyleString	  "edit,edit,checkbox,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,edit,popup(Virtex2Pro|Virtex5),checkbox,checkbox,po"
